roke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="flex items-center gap-2 grow min-w-0 overflow-visible"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0 grow overflow-visible"><button type="button" class="json-field-label font-medium cursor-text px-2 py-0.5 -mx-0.5 rounded-sm hover:bg-secondary/30 hover:shadow-xs hover:ring-1 hover:ring-ring/20 transition-all text-left truncate min-w-[80px] max-w-[50%]">name</button><button type="button" class="text-xs text-muted-foreground/50 italic cursor-text px-2 py-0.5 -mx-0.5 rounded-sm hover:bg-secondary/30 hover:shadow-xs hover:ring-1 hover:ring-ring/20 transition-all opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 text-left truncate flex-1 max-w-[40%] mr-2">Add description...</button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 justify-end shrink-0"><div class="relative"><button type="button" class="text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-md font-medium text-center flex items-center justify-between text-blue-500 bg-blue-50 hover:shadow-xs hover:ring-1 hover:ring-ring/30 active:scale-95 transition-all w-[92px]"><span>Text</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><button type="button" class="min-w-20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-center text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all hover:ring-2 hover:ring-ring/30 hover:shadow-xs active:scale-95 bg-secondary text-muted-foreground" aria-pressed="false">Optional</button></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="p-1 rounded-md hover:bg-secondary hover:text-destructive transition-colors opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-label="Delete field"><svg xmlns